#.  Linux commit ecb8ac8b1f146915aa6b96449b66dd48984caacc
#.  glibc commit d19ee3473d68ca0e794f3a8b7677a0983ae1342e
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
